  "description": "SE:Series Trail is an nimble and fast dual suspension trail platform. The aluminium frameset encompasses a solid rear triangle with a more forgiving front triangle tubeset, giving excellent ride feel, control and all day trail riding comfort. The geometry used helps maintain a balanced posture for both uphill traction and downhill control with a medium reach and balanced head tube angle. Frame designed with short seat tube to allow for long travel dropper post use and great standover clearance. Frame allows for two small water bottles to be carried on the frame, one inside the front triangle and one below the down tube. Single pivot rear suspension design provides excellent tracking, trail feedback and longevity of pivots. 140mm Suspension kinematics uses a linear leverage ratio to make the bike less sensitive to aggressive rider movement, making the handling more consistent for performance riding.",
